  "description": "IO is a lightweight .NET library that provides common utilities and abstractions for handling input/output operations. Designed to simplify file system interactions, stream handling, and serialization tasks, IO offers a clean and reusable API for consistent I/O operations across applications. Whether you're working with local files, memory streams, or structured data formats, IO helps reduce repetitive code and promotes maintainable I/O handling patterns.",
